                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1567: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>), <hi
                        rendition="#italic">at Geneva</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-04-12T18:00:00-05:00">April 12, 1933—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. Your telegram No. 167, April 7, 9 p.m. was repeated to Bogotá. The following
                    reply from Mr. Caffery is repeated to you for your information:</p>
                <p>(Here follows Telegram No. 44, April 11, 2 p.m. from Bogotá.)</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
